    {
      "id": 990000000106,
      "plugin": "Cardinal",
      "model": "TextEditor",
      "version": "2.0",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "width": 34,
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / ORIGINALS 005\nCLOCKED MODULATION STUDIO\n\n1. Start host TRANSPORT; HostTime BEAT pulse\n   drives CLOCKED LFO CLK. HostTime RESET syncs\n   oscillator phase. LFO clock lock needs 2 beats.\n2. Play HOST MIDI notes in 8-voice Reuse mode.\n   Pitch also feeds LFO RATE CV, making per-note\n   free-run rates while the transport is stopped.\n3. CLOCKED LFO sine modulates MorphVCO color;\n   triangle sweeps StateFilter cutoff; pulse\n   alternates StereoEcho dry/wet modulation.\n4. LFO EOC retriggers ADSR while MIDI gate holds.\n   Gated VCA runs into LP/HP split Echo L/R.\n5. Echo stereo outputs feed HostAudio2 L/R.\n\nCLOCK x selector: 1/4, 1/2, 1, 2, 4 cycles\nper incoming beat; this is EXTERNAL clock sync,\nnot direct BPM/transport coupling in LFO DSP.\nIf the host is stopped, LFO free-runs at RATE.\nHost/VCA gain reduced for polyphonic headroom.\nNo external sound samples or downloads.\n"
      },
      "pos": [
        105,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
